# P48 on iOS: the LazyVGrid / LazyHGrid layouts. Pass: grid 1 three flexible
# columns 1 2 3 / 4 5 6 / 7 8; grid 2 a narrow two-wide block; grid 3 several per
# row; grid 5 reads 1/2, 3/4, 5/6 across; grid 6 a staircase -- and no cell pushed
# off the edge or stacked under the wrong neighbour.
# At native size (2026-10-01) grids 1-5 are on the launch screen and grid 6 is
# below it, so the file scrolls down after the photograph-worthy part has drawn.
#
# Grid 6 draws its three lanes as grey bands (from 2026-10-01; before that the
# step was 1 pt and invisible on every backend). Pass: cells 1 and 4 against the
# top of the first band, 2 and 5 in the middle of the second, 3 and 6 against the
# bottom of the third (VERIFIED p48-ios-final-20261001-215256.png).
# grid 6 把三條 lane 畫成灰帶。通過:cell 1、4 貼第一條頂端,2、5 在第二條正中,3、6 貼第三條底端。
